# Xotik design system

## Colors (use CSS variables only)

- Structural: `--paper`, `--ink`, `--line`, `--white`
- J spectrum: `--j-coral` through `--j-violet` — one dominant accent per scene, never all six as a rainbow gradient

## Typography

- Display: Fraunces, roman only (no italic headers)
- Body: Manrope
- Labels: IBM Plex Mono, uppercase, letter-spacing 0.08em
- Hindi: Noto Sans Devanagari subset when locale is hinglish

## Components

- Primary CTA: `.btn-primary` — ink bg, paper text, pill radius
- Section padding: 20px mobile, 32px desktop
- Max content width: 1280px

## Do not

- Introduce colors outside the token set without adding a named variable
- Use generic AI dashboard patterns (purple gradients, glass blobs)
- Invent metrics, press quotes, or certification claims
- Copy user reference art pixels — mood and palette only
